{"duration": 32.11, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.52, "text": "In 2023, a team that included\nAlison Kock and Alison Towner"}, {"start": 5.52, "end": 9.98, "text": "studied great white records from\nthe whole South African coast."}, {"start": 9.98, "end": 12.28, "text": "They found that numbers\nlooked steady overall."}, {"start": 12.98, "end": 19.1, "text": "Sightings had fallen in the west and\nrisen in the east. At Algoa Bay, shore"}, {"start": 19.1, "end": 27.96, "text": "anglers caught six great whites in\n2013 and 59 in 2019. To that team, it"}, {"start": 27.96, "end": 32.11, "text": "looked as if many sharks had\nmoved east, away from the orcas."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.16, "text": "In"}, {"start": 0.16, "end": 1.76, "text": "2023,"}, {"start": 2.22, "end": 2.26, "text": "a"}, {"start": 2.26, "end": 2.56, "text": "team"}, {"start": 2.56, "end": 2.78, "text": "that"}, {"start": 2.78, "end": 3.24, "text": "included"}, {"start": 3.24, "end": 3.78, "text": "Alison"}, {"start": 3.78, "end": 4.16, "text": "Kock"}, {"start": 4.16, "end": 4.46, "text": "and"}, {"start": 4.46, "end": 4.86, "text": "Alison"}, {"start": 4.86, "end": 5.52, "text": "Towner"}, {"start": 5.52, "end": 6.12, "text": "studied"}, {"start": 6.12, "end": 6.54, "text": "great"}, {"start": 6.54, "end": 6.84, "text": "white"}, {"start": 6.84, "end": 7.3, "text": "records"}, {"start": 7.3, "end": 7.56, "text": "from"}, {"start": 7.56, "end": 7.72, "text": "the"}, {"start": 7.72, "end": 8.0, "text": "whole"}, {"start": 8.0, "end": 8.3, "text": "South"}, {"start": 8.3, "end": 8.86, "text": "African"}, {"start": 8.86, "end": 9.22, "text": "coast."}, {"start": 9.98, "end": 10.1, "text": "They"}, {"start": 10.1, "end": 10.38, "text": "found"}, {"start": 10.38, "end": 10.58, "text": "that"}, {"start": 10.58, "end": 11.0, "text": "numbers"}, {"start": 11.0, "end": 11.22, "text": "looked"}, {"start": 11.22, "end": 11.64, "text": "steady"}, {"start": 11.64, "end": 12.0, "text": "overall."}, {"